{"schemaVersion":1,"id":"reference:e0c747cff51aabe1","name":"The Mon Calamari Resistance","source":{"id":"source:reference-e0c747cff51aabe1","title":"The Mon Calamari Resistance","revision":20251,"timestamp":"2024-08-25T23:30:04Z","sha256":"b2e02ec3aba74e7704f9e831dbf4d62ca25d5247781d7c0412f95a6c4cde2830","url":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?oldid=20251","history":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?title=The%20Mon%20Calamari%20Resistance&action=history"},"article":{"sourceId":"source:reference-e0c747cff51aabe1","blocks":[{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Book: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Legacy Era Campaign Guide"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Legacy_Era_Campaign_Guide"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["After Admiral ",{"tag":"a","children":["Gar Stazi"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Gar_Stazi","referenceId":"reference:829f1014aee4c71a"}," and ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Galactic Alliance"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Galactic_Alliance","referenceId":"reference:bd53073ee6d4d9a0"}," steal the prototype ",{"tag":"a","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Imperious"]},"-Class Star Destroyer"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Imperious-Class_Star_Destroyer","referenceId":"reference:4d9dbcd2efb9d38d"}," from the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Dac"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Dac","referenceId":"reference:8654fc7bdc8fd9cb"}," shipyards, with help from former Triumvirate member ",{"tag":"a","children":["Gial Gahan"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Gial_Gahan","referenceId":"reference:c6403aa375231b89"},", ",{"tag":"a","children":["Darth Krayt"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Darth_Krayt","referenceId":"reference:c6d0b6bc88280f92"}," orders the execution of millions of ",{"tag":"a","children":["Mon Calamari"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Mon_Calamari","referenceId":"reference:5b784aed2214627b"}," and has the remaining ",{"tag":"a","children":["Mon Calamari"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Mon_Calamari","referenceId":"reference:5b784aed2214627b"}," rounded up into internment camps. Enraged, the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Mon Calamari"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Mon_Calamari","referenceId":"reference:5b784aed2214627b"}," resolve to remind the new Emperor of the lessons they taught Emperor Palpatine. On ",{"tag":"a","children":["Dac"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Dac","referenceId":"reference:8654fc7bdc8fd9cb"},", a resistance movement ignites instantaneously, supported by ",{"tag":"a","children":["Mon Calamari"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Mon_Calamari","referenceId":"reference:5b784aed2214627b"}," and their sympathizers throughout the galaxy.\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["Initially, the resistance groups are scattered and highly disorganized. Some rebel openly, while others begin to stockpile arms and resources for a much longer fight. Political rivals vie for leadership roles within the resistance. A few attempt to persuade the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Quarren"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Quarren","referenceId":"reference:f032fd9263dbff5e"}," to abandon the Empire in protest, but these efforts are unsuccessful.\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["With the Imperial threat against ",{"tag":"a","children":["Mon Calamari"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Mon_Calamari","referenceId":"reference:5b784aed2214627b"}," throughout the galaxy, an organized smuggling network is needed to rescue and transport ",{"tag":"a","children":["Mon Calamari"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Mon_Calamari","referenceId":"reference:5b784aed2214627b"}," fleeing Imperial forces. While some resort to hiring professional smugglers, most ",{"tag":"a","children":["Mon Calamari"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Mon_Calamari","referenceId":"reference:5b784aed2214627b"}," are aided by their own people using their own ",{"tag":"a","children":["Starships"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Starships"},". Thus was born the Ackbar Trail, a secret network of smuggling ships, safe houses, and hidden pathways that spirit away refugee ",{"tag":"a","children":["Mon Calamari"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Mon_Calamari","referenceId":"reference:5b784aed2214627b"}," to isolated ",{"tag":"a","children":["Space Stations"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Space_Stations","referenceId":"reference:65763f09c9074f45"},", ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Outer Rim"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Outer_Rim?action=edit&redlink=1"},", and, it is rumored, planets in ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Unknown Regions"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Unknown_Regions"},". The Ackbar Trail was named in honor of Admiral Ackbar's famous journey from slavery under ",{"tag":"a","children":["Grand Moff Tarkin"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Grand_Moff_Tarkin?action=edit&redlink=1"}," to become a Rebel Alliance Admiral who defeated his former masters, the original Galactic Empire. Metaphorically speaking, the implications of the name are not lost on the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Mon Calamari"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Mon_Calamari","referenceId":"reference:5b784aed2214627b"},", and many now find themselves on a similar path.\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["Eventually, The Mon Calamari Resistance and the Ackbar Trail provide vital assistance to ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Galactic Alliance"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Galactic_Alliance","referenceId":"reference:bd53073ee6d4d9a0"}," in the form of recruits and resources, and may even someday spark the creation of effective rebel groups and resistance fighters throughout the galaxy.\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h2","children":["Mon Calamari Resistance Units"]},"\n",{"tag":"h4","children":["Nonheroic Units"]},"\n",{"tag":"table","children":["\n",{"tag":"tbody","children":[{"tag":"tr","children":["\n",{"tag":"th","children":["NAME\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"th","children":["CHALLENGE LEVEL\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"th","children":["SOURCE\n"]}]},"\n",{"tag":"tr","children":["\n",{"tag":"td","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Mon Calamari Resistance Member"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Mon_Calamari_Resistance_Member","referenceId":"reference:223690ba71678816"},"\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":["CL 2\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":[{"tag":"i","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Legacy Era Campaign Guide"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Legacy_Era_Campaign_Guide"}]},"\n"]}]}]}]},"\n",{"tag":"h4","children":["Heroic Units"]},"\n",{"tag":"table","children":["\n",{"tag":"tbody","children":[{"tag":"tr","children":["\n",{"tag":"th","children":["NAME\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"th","children":["CHALLENGE LEVEL\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"th","children":["SOURCE\n"]}]},"\n",{"tag":"tr","children":["\n",{"tag":"td","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Gial Gahan"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Gial_Gahan","referenceId":"reference:c6403aa375231b89"},"\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":["CL 14\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":[{"tag":"i","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Legacy Era Campaign Guide"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Legacy_Era_Campaign_Guide"}]},"\n"]}]}]}]},"\n",{"tag":"h4","children":["Vehicles"]},"\n",{"tag":"table","children":["\n",{"tag":"tbody","children":[{"tag":"tr","children":["\n",{"tag":"th","children":["NAME\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"th","children":["CHALLENGE LEVEL\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"th","children":["TYPE\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"th","children":["SOURCE\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"th","children":["IMAGE\n"]}]},"\n",{"tag":"tr","children":["\n",{"tag":"td","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["MC-24a Light Shuttle"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/MC-24a_Light_Shuttle","referenceId":"reference:b0a87fc8575da979"},"\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":["CL 6\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Space Transports"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Space_Transports","referenceId":"reference:082a04e1f80578b3"},"\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":[{"tag":"i","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Legacy Era Campaign Guide"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Legacy_Era_Campaign_Guide"}]},"\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":["\n"]}]}]}]},"\n","\n",{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"br","children":[]},"\n"]},"\n","\n","\n","\n\n","\n\n","\n"]}}
